#: src/SettingsDialog.cpp:54
#, c-format
msgid ""
"The &lt;SUPER&gt;+%u combination seems already mapped to another command.\n"
"Check your Xfce keyboard settings."
msgstr ""
"ປຸ່ມ &lt;SUPER&gt;+%u ດ້ານຊ້າຍ ເບິ່ງຄືວ່າຖືກກຳນົດໃຫ້ກັບຄຳສັ່ງອື່ນແລ້ວ..\n"
"ກວດສອບການຕັ້ງຄ່າແປ້ນພິມ Xfce ຂອງທ່ານ."

